{"title":"Career roadmap — Finance Analyst","role":"Finance Analyst","summary":"A Finance Analyst analyses financial data to support budgeting, forecasting, profitability analysis, management reporting, investment decisions, and business planning. For a B.Com Accounting & Taxation student, the integrated CA/CMA/CS orientation provides a strong accounting and compliance foundation; adding financial modelling, analytics, business partnering, and technology creates a stronger finance profile.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Com (Bachelor of Commerce)","Course":"B.Com – Accounting & Taxation (Integrated with CA/CMA/CS)"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The strongest route is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Accounting","Financial Analysis","Excel & Financial Modelling","FP&A","Business Analytics","Finance Business Partnering","Finance Leadership"]}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","What to focus on"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Accounting, financial statements, Excel, budgeting, forecasting, financial analysis"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"FP&A, business partnering, management reporting, Power BI, SQL, ERP"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Strategic finance, scenario modelling, automation, predictive analytics"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"AI-enabled FP&A, autonomous forecasting, real-time finance, strategic finance leadership"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Accounting + finance foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Financial accounting"},{"text":"Cost accounting"},{"text":"Management accounting"},{"text":"Corporate finance basics"},{"text":"Business economics"},{"text":"Financial statements"},{"text":"Balance Sheet"},{"text":"Profit & Loss"},{"text":"Cash Flow Statement"},{"text":"Working capital"},{"text":"Depreciation"},{"text":"Inventory"},{"text":"Accounts receivable/payable"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Build strong Excel skills:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"XLOOKUP"},{"text":"INDEX/MATCH"},{"text":"SUMIFS"},{"text":"IF/IFS"},{"text":"PivotTables"},{"text":"Charts"},{"text":"Data validation"},{"text":"Conditional formatting"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Also learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Basic taxation"},{"text":"Budgeting concepts"},{"text":"Financial ratios"},{"text":"Business communication"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Financial analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn to analyse company performance."},{"type":"h","text":"Ratio analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Current ratio"},{"text":"Quick ratio"},{"text":"Debt-to-equity"},{"text":"Interest coverage"},{"text":"ROE"},{"text":"ROA"},{"text":"ROCE"},{"text":"Gross margin"},{"text":"EBITDA margin"},{"text":"Net margin"},{"text":"Asset turnover"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Financial analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revenue analysis"},{"text":"Cost analysis"},{"text":"Profitability analysis"},{"text":"Working-capital analysis"},{"text":"Cash-flow analysis"},{"text":"Variance analysis"},{"text":"Break-even analysis"},{"text":"Contribution analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Budgeting"},{"type":"p","text":"Understand:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Actual","Budget","Variance","Reason","Corrective Action"]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — FP&A + financial modelling"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop professional skills in:"},{"type":"h","text":"Financial modelling"},{"type":"p","text":"Build:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Historical Financials","Assumptions","Forecast","Scenario Analysis","Management Insights"]},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revenue forecasting"},{"text":"Cost forecasting"},{"text":"P&L forecasting"},{"text":"Cash-flow forecasting"},{"text":"Working-capital modelling"},{"text":"Capex planning"},{"text":"Depreciation"},{"text":"Debt modelling"},{"text":"Sensitivity analysis"},{"text":"Scenario modelling"}]},{"type":"h","text":"FP&A"},{"type":"p","text":"Master:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Annual budgeting"},{"text":"Rolling forecasts"},{"text":"Monthly management reporting"},{"text":"KPI analysis"},{"text":"Business-unit analysis"},{"text":"Headcount planning"},{"text":"Cost control"},{"text":"Management dashboards"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Add:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Power Query"},{"text":"ERP fundamentals"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Final year — Finance portfolio"},{"type":"h","text":"Project 1 — Three-Statement Financial Model"},{"type":"p","text":"Create a complete model containing:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Income Statement","Balance Sheet","Cash Flow"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Use historical data and build a 3–5 year forecast."},{"type":"p","text":"Include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revenue assumptions"},{"text":"Cost assumptions"},{"text":"Working capital"},{"text":"Capex"},{"text":"Debt"},{"text":"Cash balance"},{"text":"Scenario analysis"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 2 — FP&A Dashboard"},{"type":"p","text":"Build a Power BI dashboard showing:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Revenue"},{"text":"Gross profit"},{"text":"EBITDA"},{"text":"Operating expenses"},{"text":"Net profit"},{"text":"Budget vs actual"},{"text":"Monthly variance"},{"text":"Business-unit performance"},{"text":"Cash flow"},{"text":"Key KPIs"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Project 3 — Business Investment Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"Evaluate a fictional investment/project using:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Initial investment"},{"text":"Revenue projections"},{"text":"Operating costs"},{"text":"Cash flows"},{"text":"NPV"},{"text":"IRR"},{"text":"Payback period"},{"text":"Sensitivity analysis"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Finish with:"},{"type":"h","text":"Invest / Do Not Invest + Financial Rationale"},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation options