ecast and deciding what management should do next."},{"type":"h","text":"2. Real-Time Finance"},{"type":"p","text":"Finance teams will increasingly move from:"},{"type":"h","text":"Month-end reporting → Continuous financial visibility"},{"type":"p","text":"ERP and operational systems can increasingly connect:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Sales","Inventory","Expenses","Cash","Forecast","Management Dashboard"]},{"type":"p","text":"This makes data and systems knowledge increasingly important."},{"type":"h","text":"3. Finance Analytics"},{"type":"p","text":"High-value skills will include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"SQL"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Python"},{"text":"Statistics"},{"text":"Predictive analytics"},{"text":"Data modelling"},{"text":"Financial APIs"},{"text":"Automation"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A Finance Analyst who can combine finance + analytics will have stronger long-term prospects."},{"type":"h","text":"4. Strategic Finance"},{"type":"p","text":"Finance professionals will increasingly participate in decisions involving:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Pricing"},{"text":"Product profitability"},{"text":"Market expansion"},{"text":"M&A"},{"text":"Capital allocation"},{"text":"Cost optimisation"},{"text":"Scenario planning"},{"text":"Business strategy"}]},{"type":"p","text":"This moves the role beyond reporting into decision support."},{"type":"note","label":"2040–2046","text":"How the role evolves"},{"type":"p","text":"Traditional:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Finance Analyst","Collect data","Prepare reports","Calculate variances"]},{"type":"p","text":"Future:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Strategic Finance Professional","Monitor business performance","Forecast outcomes","Model scenarios","Identify risks/opportunities","Recommend decisions"]},{"type":"p","text":"The profession increasingly combines:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Accounting","Finance","Analytics","Technology","Strategy","AI"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"h","text":"Recommended final skill stack"},{